<title>USA: BPA out of daily power market again for Friday.</title>
<headline>BPA out of daily power market again for Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) offered no surplus power for Friday schedulings, the agency said Thursday.</p>
<p>The agency first pulled out of the market on Wednesday, citing low streamflows, earlier block power sales and the start of fish spill programs at Snake River hydropower projects.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau +1 213 622 0056))</p>
</text>
